  <section id="GUID-3AE5D96E-6AF3-4C59-8E1C-46B1656413A2"> 
	 <title>NVL-HX LPCAMM2 T3 RVP – LPCAMM Connectivity Update</title> 
	 <ul id="GUID-876D7E99-B6AF-48E4-B4C3-A2E694EBFE39"> 
		<li>LPCAMM2 connector CS_2,3 signals to be terminated with pull up resistor 10Kohm to VDD2H_CPU. 
		</li> 
		<li>LPCAMM2 connector Pin P12 to be connected to GND. 
		</li> 
		<li>LPCAMM2 connector Pin A28 to be terminated with pull up resistor 22Kohm instead 10Khom to 1.8V. 
		</li> 
	 </ul> 
  </section> 
   
